{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n back numberさんの水平線がすごく好きです。\n \n \n 誰の心に残ることも目に焼き付くこともない毎日だけど、自分の中の心にずっと残るような日々を過ごしたいですね☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHCJ6H78QZ88CS81H6BCV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHDMS8YSPZWVGHVJBPNDS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHET0F9ABMDSQ1TQY2446","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHFV6W0A72KF90HT7JK6B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHH0JYHCXFY74FXGZ1264","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHJ1KP1NMN8C6H4457X43","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n フィルムカメラで撮ると何でも好きな雰囲気になる☺︎\n \n 日付が大変なことになっていて変なところで切ってしまったりしたから次から気をつけなければ…！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETHK2BHWA43VZ1A7PZYA6A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"}